This directory holds machine-readable benchmark evidence:

- cpu_baseline.json / cpu_baseline.md  (hydrofragments.benchmarks.cpu_baseline)
- cuda_parity.json / cuda_parity.md    (hydrofragments.benchmarks.cuda_parity)
- cuda_transfer_cost.json / .md        (hydrofragments.benchmarks.cuda_transfer_cost)
- cuda_baseline.json                   (hand-assembled evidence-gate summary;
                                         see docs/acceleration.md for schema)

No cuda_baseline.json ships in this repo by default: no GPU host has yet
recorded parity + net-speedup evidence for any CUDA_CANDIDATE_STAGES entry.
Until one exists, hydrofragments.compute.capabilities.detect_capabilities
always returns enabled_cuda_stages=() -- this is expected, not a bug. See
docs/acceleration.md.
